                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Responsive websites that provide a consistent experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Custom web applications designed around your workflows, users, and business rules.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Secure portals that connect customers, employees, and partners with the information they need.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Integrations and APIs that connect your web platform with CRM, ERP, payment, and other business systems.</p></li>
                    <li><p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Ongoing optimization and support to keep your digital platforms reliable and effective.</p></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

